      "evidence_id": "pdfplumber:abstract",
      "source": "pdf_layout",
      "field": "abstract",
      "raw_text": "In the context offully-homomorphic-encryption, we consider the representation of large integers by their decomposition over a product of rings (through theChinese Remainder Theorem) and introduce a new algorithm for the determination of the sign solely through the knowledge of ring-components. Our implementation with 128 bits of security deliv- ers a correct result with a probability higher than 1 − 10−12 in less than 140 ms for 32-bit integers on a laptop.",
